OL,3,ATiger attack park closed for third day
OL,4,
OL,5,FYorkshire Wildlife Park remains closed
OL,6,Ffor a third day as investigations
OL,7,Fcontinue into the death of a man who
OL,8,Fwas attacked by a tiger when he entered
OL,9,Fits enclosure.
OL,11,FThe park near Doncaster was closed over
OL,12,Fthe weekend after reports of a man
OL,13,Fclimbing down into the enclosure from a
OL,14,Fwalkway on Saturday afternoon.
OL,16,FAn eyewitness described seeing the man
OL,17,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,18,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,19,Fand was attacked.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
